1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
(Tsumura) Masaki Igawa and Mayumi Igawa each had their memories altered.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,099
I was living as a different person.

3
00:00:09,099 --> 00:00:11,792
(Yuri) You are... my husband!

4
00:00:11,792 --> 00:00:14,132
(Igawa) The person I love is Mayumi.

5
00:00:14,132 --> 00:00:15,957
Yusuke!

6
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,264
Come back and stop it!

7
00:00:20,264 --> 00:00:22,066
Please don't follow me any further

8
00:00:22,066 --> 00:00:24,759
No, her real name is Nanami Ishino.

9
00:00:24,759 --> 00:00:27,594
This is the murderer who killed my husband seven years ago.

10
00:00:27,594 --> 00:00:29,561
Mayumi Igawa left town?

11
00:00:29,561 --> 00:00:32,297
(Tada) I'm currently waiting to hear from the driver who picked me up.

12
00:00:32,297 --> 00:00:34,528
Someone came, Mr. Sudo...

13
00:00:34,528 --> 00:00:36,759
Does that mean he was watching you?

14
00:00:36,759 --> 00:00:39,132
Why would you do that? Where are you going?

15
00:00:39,132 --> 00:00:41,759
Maybe he was chasing Mayumi.

16
00:00:50,297 --> 00:00:52,132
(Mayumi) ≪I was happy≫

17
00:00:52,132 --> 00:00:56,099
《Welcome back》 《Welcome back》

18
00:00:56,099 --> 00:00:59,957
(Mayumi) ≪This is my life...≫

19
00:00:59,957 --> 00:01:08,429
♬〜

20
00:01:09,429 --> 00:01:11,264
《Kya! 》

21
00:01:11,264 --> 00:01:17,726
♬〜

22
00:01:17,726 --> 00:01:20,759
(Mayumi) ≪But it was different≫

23
00:01:20,759 --> 00:01:25,363
≪Everything… the life that was created≫

24
00:01:25,363 --> 00:01:29,759
《Let's live somewhere else together》

25
00:01:29,759 --> 00:01:38,462
♬〜

26
00:01:38,462 --> 00:01:40,858
(Mayumi) <<I am...>>

27
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,165
(Mayumi) ≪Regain my life≫

28
00:01:46,165 --> 00:01:47,825
(sound of door closing)

29
00:01:47,825 --> 00:01:55,561
♬〜

30
00:01:55,561 --> 00:02:01,231
(Presiding judge) Main defendant Nanami Ishino

31
00:02:01,231 --> 00:02:04,495
Punished with 10 years' imprisonment》

32
00:02:04,495 --> 00:02:07,198
(Kumiko) 《Please give me the death penalty! 》

33
00:02:07,198 --> 00:02:10,957
``I killed my precious son! 》

34
00:02:10,957 --> 00:02:13,198
《Death penalty...》

35
00:02:13,198 --> 00:02:29,561
♬〜

36
00:02:38,594 --> 00:02:41,825
Where are you heading?

37
00:02:41,825 --> 00:02:43,495
here we go…

38
00:02:43,495 --> 00:02:48,297
But it doesn't seem like she's blindly searching for Nanami Ishino.

39
00:02:48,297 --> 00:02:51,792
Looks like you have something in mind

40
00:02:51,792 --> 00:02:53,792
Did you have any contact with those two?

41
00:02:53,792 --> 00:02:59,825
No, not really... I feel like we're just neighbors.

42
00:02:59,825 --> 00:03:02,000
but…

43
00:03:03,726 --> 00:03:09,198
When I think about it, I feel like those two were always watching me.

44
00:03:10,231 --> 00:03:12,429
(Mitsuru/Takako)《Hello》《Ah, hello》

45
00:03:12,429 --> 00:03:14,495
《Welcome》 《Yes, I'm coming》

46
00:03:14,495 --> 00:03:16,957
(Mitsuru/Takako)《Hello》《Ah, hello》

47
00:03:16,957 --> 00:03:18,726
《Back from work? " "Yeah"

48
00:03:18,726 --> 00:03:21,264
《Thank you for your hard work》

49
00:03:21,264 --> 00:03:25,561
Maybe he was watching you two.

50
00:03:25,561 --> 00:03:30,924
Did you know that the two of you are different people?

51
00:03:30,924 --> 00:03:50,924
♬〜

52
00:03:50,924 --> 00:03:56,330
♬〜

53
00:03:56,330 --> 00:03:58,957
(chime)

54
00:03:58,957 --> 00:04:01,165
(Kumiko) Yes.

55
00:04:04,924 --> 00:04:07,099
It has been a while

56
00:04:07,099 --> 00:04:10,891
Why are you here...

57
00:04:10,891 --> 00:04:12,561
(Mayumi) Oh, please wait.

58
00:04:12,561 --> 00:04:14,825
Shouldn't you be in jail? Why are you coming out?

59
00:04:14,825 --> 00:04:16,759
Please, let me meet Miu!

60
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:19,594
Go back! (Mayumi) Ah...

61
00:04:19,594 --> 00:04:22,396
Ah... no!

62
00:04:22,396 --> 00:04:25,264
Ah... (Mayumi) No... no...

63
00:04:25,264 --> 00:04:28,198
you! help me! That woman!

64
00:04:28,198 --> 00:04:31,198
Please wait! Please wait! (Hironobu) What happened!

65
00:04:31,198 --> 00:04:32,858
Um... (Hironobu) Call the police!

66
00:04:32,858 --> 00:04:38,000
(Mayumi) Wait, wait! Miu... Where is Miu?

67
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,429
Please let me meet Miu

68
00:04:40,429 --> 00:04:42,891
That child isn't there

69
00:04:42,891 --> 00:04:45,132
Huh? (Hironobu) Not here

70
00:04:45,132 --> 00:04:47,132
Come back!

71
00:04:47,132 --> 00:04:48,891
What do you mean?

72
00:04:48,891 --> 00:04:51,924
It's natural, isn't it? Murder...

73
00:04:51,924 --> 00:04:57,297
There's no way a woman who killed her son could raise a child!

74
00:04:57,297 --> 00:05:05,066
♬〜

75
00:05:05,066 --> 00:05:07,297
Where is that kid?

76
00:05:16,858 --> 00:05:19,132
I'll go from the back yes

77
00:05:19,132 --> 00:05:27,297
♬〜

78
00:05:27,297 --> 00:05:30,396
It's a children's home.

79
00:05:30,396 --> 00:05:32,627
Nanami Ishino has a daughter

80
00:05:32,627 --> 00:05:37,627
What... here?

81
00:05:37,627 --> 00:05:40,957
Maybe

82
00:05:40,957 --> 00:05:45,297
No one in my family takes care of me...

83
00:05:45,297 --> 00:05:50,891
If Nanami Ishino appears here, it means her memory has returned.

84
00:05:50,891 --> 00:05:54,462
Then I can ask what happened.

85
00:05:54,462 --> 00:06:02,330
♬〜

86
00:06:02,330 --> 00:06:05,000
Ah... Huh?

87
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:11,660
♬〜

88
00:06:11,660 --> 00:06:13,825
Mayumi...

89
00:06:14,825 --> 00:06:16,825
Ninomiya!

90
00:06:19,825 --> 00:06:23,231
Did any women visit you today?

91
00:06:23,231 --> 00:06:30,264
♬〜

92
00:06:30,264 --> 00:06:33,165
Mr. Igawa

93
00:06:33,165 --> 00:06:36,462
What are you doing in a place like this... stop... I don't like it...

94
00:06:36,462 --> 00:06:39,132
Hey!

95
00:06:39,132 --> 00:06:41,792
let's go! Wait...

96
00:06:41,792 --> 00:06:46,825
♬〜

97
00:06:46,825 --> 00:06:48,726
Mayumi?

98
00:06:48,726 --> 00:06:57,858
♬〜

99
00:06:57,858 --> 00:07:00,363
(Mitsuru) Uh... ah!

100
00:07:00,363 --> 00:07:03,858
There's a car parked there. Run!

101
00:07:05,924 --> 00:07:08,330
You want to see your daughter! Ugh...!

102
00:07:08,330 --> 00:07:10,561
Then run away now!

103
00:07:10,561 --> 00:07:12,297
quickly!

104
00:07:14,330 --> 00:07:16,000
let's go!

105
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:36,000
♬〜

106
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,957
Ride!

107
00:07:42,231 --> 00:07:44,363
Get it out! yes!

108
00:07:44,363 --> 00:07:56,132
♬〜

109
00:07:56,132 --> 00:08:00,891
(Tada) Huh? Did you manage to escape? What are you doing!

110
00:08:00,891 --> 00:08:03,297
Yeah, Ninomiya was there too?

111
00:08:03,297 --> 00:08:06,297
I don't know. That's no excuse.

112
00:08:06,297 --> 00:08:08,759
It would have been better if we had caught it together.

113
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:12,858
It's over, it's over, Barca!

114
00:08:17,594 --> 00:08:20,627
(Rie) Did Nanami Ishino run away?

115
00:08:20,627 --> 00:08:23,594
(Tada) No, (Rie) What kind of lie is this?

116
00:08:23,594 --> 00:08:26,594
If you know what it is, don't ask!

117
00:08:26,594 --> 00:08:28,858
Mr. Ninomiya too?

118
00:08:28,858 --> 00:08:32,462
Ah, it looks like I've come to help you.

119
00:08:32,462 --> 00:08:36,792
I still think of her as my wife... right?

120
00:08:36,792 --> 00:08:38,924
Is it love?

121
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:44,165
(Reception) Welcome, this is Tsumura, who made the reservation.

122
00:08:44,165 --> 00:08:46,792
(Reception) Please fill in here

123
00:08:55,033 --> 00:08:58,627
For now, here today

124
00:08:58,627 --> 00:09:00,627
Sorry

125
00:09:04,033 --> 00:09:10,528
Can you tell me what happened, Nanami Ishino?

126
00:09:10,528 --> 00:09:14,561
Your memory has returned, hasn't it?

127
00:09:21,957 --> 00:09:25,066
Don't be afraid

128
00:09:25,066 --> 00:09:27,726
Huh?

129
00:09:27,726 --> 00:09:30,165
I…

130
00:09:30,165 --> 00:09:32,132
I didn't kill him.

131
00:09:32,132 --> 00:09:38,891
♬〜

132
00:09:38,891 --> 00:09:43,297
When I got home that day, my husband was dead.

133
00:09:45,099 --> 00:09:48,495
《I'll be home in a little while》

134
00:09:50,462 --> 00:09:54,396
(Nanami)《Arrived》

135
00:09:54,396 --> 00:09:56,627
《Yoisho》

136
00:09:57,660 --> 00:10:01,825
"Are you okay? Miwa hehehehe let's go》

137
00:10:04,462 --> 00:10:06,396
《Tatsuya? 》

138
00:10:06,396 --> 00:10:09,396
《I have a lot of luggage, so please help me》

139
00:10:09,396 --> 00:10:17,198
♬〜

140
00:10:17,198 --> 00:10:19,396
《Miu, please wait a moment》

141
00:10:19,396 --> 00:10:39,396
♬〜

142
00:10:39,396 --> 00:10:46,891
♬〜

143
00:10:46,891 --> 00:10:48,726
(Nanami)《Ah...》

144
00:10:48,726 --> 00:10:58,693
♬〜

145
00:10:58,693 --> 00:11:00,693
《Tatsuya? 》

146
00:11:00,693 --> 00:11:08,396
《(Police car siren)》

147
00:11:08,396 --> 00:11:16,330
♬〜

148
00:11:16,330 --> 00:11:20,429
《It's Nanami Ishino》

149
00:11:20,429 --> 00:11:23,660
《Can I talk to you? 》

150
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:26,000
《What is your relationship with your husband Tatsuya?

151
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:29,000
It seems like it went bankrupt a long time ago.

152
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:32,957
《The cause is Tatsuya-san’s affair》

153
00:11:32,957 --> 00:11:36,165
《What is that? 》 (Detective)《The fights never stopped.

154
00:11:36,165 --> 00:11:39,000
I heard from a neighbor》

155
00:11:41,099 --> 00:11:43,858
``You hated him, didn't you? 》

156
00:11:45,264 --> 00:11:47,165
"what do you mean? 》

157
00:11:47,165 --> 00:11:50,858
《Your fingerprints were on the knife that became the murder weapon》

158
00:11:50,858 --> 00:11:52,693
``You killed Tatsuya, didn't you? 》

159
00:11:52,693 --> 00:11:55,033
``What are you talking about? 》

160
00:11:55,033 --> 00:11:58,726
``I didn't kill you! 》

161
00:11:58,726 --> 00:12:00,924
《Please let me meet my daughter, please let me meet Miu! 》

162
00:12:00,924 --> 00:12:02,594
(Detective)《Sit down! " "I beg you"

163
00:12:02,594 --> 00:12:04,462
(Detective)《Stop! 》 《Please stop! 》

164
00:12:04,462 --> 00:12:07,231
``This is some kind of mistake, please stop! 》

165
00:12:07,231 --> 00:12:09,099
``I didn't kill you! 》 (Detective) 《Noisy! 》

166
00:12:09,099 --> 00:12:12,297
《Please let me meet Miu》

167
00:12:12,297 --> 00:12:14,495
Like that...

168
00:12:16,726 --> 00:12:21,132
No matter what I said, they wouldn't listen to me

169
00:12:22,792 --> 00:12:28,495
(Mayumi) After losing Miu, I was as good as dead.

170
00:12:31,495 --> 00:12:34,264
How did you get out?

171
00:12:37,198 --> 00:12:40,495
Can't remember something?

172
00:12:41,627 --> 00:12:44,561
Someone in the same room accused me of something I didn't understand.

173
00:12:44,561 --> 00:12:49,924
For some reason I was relegated to solitary confinement.

174
00:12:49,924 --> 00:12:57,429
♬〜

175
00:12:57,429 --> 00:13:02,429
(Mayumi) That day, when I ate dinner, I suddenly felt sleepy...

176
00:13:04,726 --> 00:13:06,396
《(Sound of door opening)》

177
00:13:06,396 --> 00:13:09,858
"(footsteps)"

178
00:13:09,858 --> 00:13:19,594
♬〜

179
00:13:19,594 --> 00:13:24,825
(Mayumi) The last thing I saw was a long hallway.

180
00:13:24,825 --> 00:13:27,528
Gray...

181
00:13:27,528 --> 00:13:29,858
After that...

182
00:13:33,627 --> 00:13:36,627
"(footsteps)"

183
00:13:36,627 --> 00:13:38,858
《Welcome back》

184
00:13:38,858 --> 00:13:41,066
"I'm home"

185
00:13:44,858 --> 00:13:47,363
I was with you

186
00:13:47,363 --> 00:13:52,627
♬〜

187
00:13:52,627 --> 00:13:55,198
Who got you out of jail?

188
00:13:55,198 --> 00:13:58,759
Was there anyone else besides the prison guard?

189
00:14:00,066 --> 00:14:03,231
There was one woman I didn't know.

190
00:14:06,924 --> 00:14:09,198
it is…

191
00:14:10,231 --> 00:14:12,891
Maybe...

192
00:14:17,627 --> 00:14:19,627
this person

193
00:14:19,627 --> 00:14:29,627
♬〜

194
00:14:29,627 --> 00:14:31,792
(Guard)《This is Nanami Ishino》

195
00:14:31,792 --> 00:14:33,792
(Guard)《Please》

196
00:14:33,792 --> 00:14:40,792
♬〜

197
00:14:40,792 --> 00:14:43,660
(Guard)《Seno...Yes》

198
00:14:45,825 --> 00:14:48,594
Who is it?

199
00:14:50,066 --> 00:14:54,726
Mutsumi Kosaka, my old boss.

200
00:14:57,858 --> 00:15:01,858
(Kousaka) Nanami Ishino seems to have regained her memory.

201
00:15:01,858 --> 00:15:07,198
I think it would be good to know about the Persona Shift program.

202
00:15:07,198 --> 00:15:09,627
I will report again.

203
00:15:09,627 --> 00:15:19,165
♬〜

204
00:15:19,165 --> 00:15:24,330
When did you get your memory back?

205
00:15:24,330 --> 00:15:27,561
At first...

206
00:15:27,561 --> 00:15:29,627
when petr died

207
00:15:29,627 --> 00:15:32,528
《Kya! 》

208
00:15:32,528 --> 00:15:35,066
Peter?

209
00:15:35,066 --> 00:15:39,264
Ah, this is the sparrow I kept.

210
00:15:39,264 --> 00:15:41,627
I started getting a headache

211
00:15:41,627 --> 00:15:45,561
Memories from before started coming to mind

212
00:15:45,561 --> 00:15:48,891
At that time I didn't know what it was

213
00:15:48,891 --> 00:15:52,495
But I remembered everything...

214
00:15:55,099 --> 00:15:59,594
when I heard you died

215
00:16:02,330 --> 00:16:06,099
《Ugh... ah...》

216
00:16:06,099 --> 00:16:08,198
《Ah...》

217
00:16:11,198 --> 00:16:14,132
Was that an accident?

218
00:16:14,132 --> 00:16:19,132
(Mayumi) A man named Tada who worked at the same place as you came to my house.

219
00:16:19,132 --> 00:16:23,561
♬〜

220
00:16:23,561 --> 00:16:25,858
《Masaki Igawa met with an accident》

221
00:16:25,858 --> 00:16:28,000
《What? 》 (Tada)《From the mountain path

222
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:31,924
It looks like it fell down to the river below...

223
00:16:31,924 --> 00:16:34,000
《What, where is your husband now? 》

224
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:36,759
``Are you okay? 》

225
00:16:36,759 --> 00:16:39,693
《I don't know where I am.》

226
00:16:46,066 --> 00:16:50,165
(Tada)《This was discovered downstream》

227
00:16:52,693 --> 00:16:54,759
《Like that...》

228
00:16:54,759 --> 00:16:57,660
《It's very unfortunate, but...》

229
00:16:57,660 --> 00:17:17,726
♬〜

230
00:17:17,726 --> 00:17:23,957
♬〜

231
00:17:23,957 --> 00:17:27,000
(Mayumi) I remembered everything there.

232
00:17:28,759 --> 00:17:30,594
(Mayumi) The man in front of me is

233
00:17:30,594 --> 00:17:34,198
It was the man I saw at the place where I was taken.

234
00:17:34,198 --> 00:17:36,528
Mr. Tada?

235
00:17:36,528 --> 00:17:47,429
♬〜

236
00:17:47,429 --> 00:17:50,660
Why Tada-san...

237
00:17:50,660 --> 00:17:53,297
That man tampered with the memories of both of you.

238
00:17:53,297 --> 00:17:55,924
I guess he was involved.

239
00:17:57,066 --> 00:18:00,396
I wanted to know what was happening to me

240
00:18:00,396 --> 00:18:03,198
The only way to do that is to investigate this man.

241
00:18:03,198 --> 00:18:06,462
I thought if I missed this, I wouldn't be able to do that...

242
00:18:06,462 --> 00:18:10,627
Is that why you pretended to think Tada was Masaki Igawa?

243
00:18:10,627 --> 00:18:12,726
That's all I could think of right away

244
00:18:12,726 --> 00:18:15,594
There's a way to stop it

245
00:18:15,594 --> 00:18:18,231
It was the worst though

246
00:18:23,132 --> 00:18:26,066
《Ma-kun...》

247
00:18:26,066 --> 00:18:28,132
《What? 》

248
00:18:28,132 --> 00:18:30,759
"good…"

249
00:18:32,231 --> 00:18:37,000
《I was worried when I heard that there was an accident》

250
00:18:40,033 --> 00:18:43,033
《Really good》

251
00:18:46,297 --> 00:18:48,792
《So-so... Yeah...》

252
00:18:51,033 --> 00:18:53,528
《It seems like my memory is getting cloudy.》

253
00:18:53,528 --> 00:18:56,462
《You mistake me for Masaki Igawa》

254
00:18:56,462 --> 00:18:59,792
《Ah, no, is it dangerous to erase Masaki Igawa's memory?》

255
00:18:59,792 --> 00:19:01,462
《(Sound of door opening)》

256
00:19:01,462 --> 00:19:03,891
《When I erased my memory that far back.

257
00:19:03,891 --> 00:19:06,495
I can't predict what will happen at all.

258
00:19:06,495 --> 00:19:09,099
《I'll try my best here》

259
00:19:11,264 --> 00:19:13,066
《(Sound of power on)》

260
00:19:16,759 --> 00:19:18,693
(Tada)《Good morning》

261
00:19:18,693 --> 00:19:23,462
《Good morning Ma-kun》 《It's a nice morning. It's such a nice morning.》

262
00:19:23,462 --> 00:19:26,594
《As expected... kiss me?》

263
00:19:26,594 --> 00:19:29,891
《Hehehehe》 (Tada)《As expected》

264
00:19:32,759 --> 00:19:35,396
(Mayumi) It was really the worst.

265
00:19:35,396 --> 00:19:38,066
